an just a fleeting connection.\"}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"text\": \"The evidence points to a deep-seated commitment to the institution, where she had been an active contributor to the academic landscape.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"One of the earliest indications of Maria João Gouveia's affiliation with the University of Porto can be traced back to her research publications.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"A cursory glance at her ORCID profile reveals a plethora of scholarly articles, many of which were co-authored with colleagues from the University of Porto.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"This collaboration is a testament to her involvement with the institution, where she had been working alongside fellow researchers to advance knowledge in her field.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Further investigation reveals that Maria João Gouveia had been an integral part of various research projects undertaken by the University of Porto.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Her expertise had been sought after by colleagues from diverse departments, a clear indication of her reputation as a leading researcher in her field.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The University of Porto's research database, a treasure trove of academic endeavors, lists Maria João Gouveia as a key contributor to several projects, further solidifying her connection to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Moreover, Maria João Gouveia's presence at the University of Porto is also reflected in her teaching engagements.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"As an esteemed researcher, she had been invited to share her knowledge with students, imparting her expertise to the next generation of scholars.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Her lectures, seminars, and workshops had been an integral part of the university's curriculum, leaving an indelible mark on the academic landscape.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"The University of Porto's faculty directory, a comprehensive listing of academic 